+ * mpi_internal_get_comm() does for a single one.
+ *
+ * The arrays are parallel: comms_out[i] is the communicator of
+ * requests_in[i], and is MPI_COMM_NULL where that request has none.
+ * comms_out must hold at least inum entries.  Useful in the array forms
+ * of the completion calls (wait_all, test_some and friends).
